== K13 the general gate: constant anomaly = c*a0 with c = lim x(1-mu(x))
   mu_can  = x/(1+x)      -> c = 1   (check: g*mu(g/a0) - g^2/(g+a0) = 0)
   mu_quad = (sqrt(1+4x^2)-1)/(2x) -> c = 1/2
   bound requires c <= B_E/a0 = 0.000391026 ; canonical c = 1 (2557.4 x over)
K13  PASS 2557.37705               > 1 (excluded)           any interpolation with a 1/x term in mu has a constant anomaly c*a0; c must be < 0.000391

